notes.body:
@rknall As of your and my comment, i would like to keep the "old" company name to match the EDS, PLC-Tool, ODVA values. This also makes it easier for future updates.

> As a side-note, B&R might not be the only company which did not change their official registration name and therefore the ODVA lists may be massively out of date. Not a stopping block per-se, just something to keep in mind.

While doing this change i also though about that, but when looking over the change there are currently more likely way more company name "fixes" then the other way round.
